  "content": "\n\n**![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fiAUqv3y.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/iAUqv3y.png</a>)**</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#930\"><strong>蒐集遊戲中所有生物的頭顱！</strong></span></h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px\">多虧這個數據包，遊戲中的每種生物現在都能掉落自己的頭顱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px\">但殭屍、骷髏與苦力怕的頭顱掉落規則維持不變。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"color:#333;font-size:14px\">要獲得它們，你仍然需要在它們旁邊引爆一隻充電苦力怕。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:18px\"><strong>你可以召喚遊戲中無法自然生成的特殊怪物。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">只需將衛道士的名稱改為<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>illusioner</strong></span>，即可召喚<strong>幻術師</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需將骷髏馬的名稱改為<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>zombie</strong></span>，即可召喚<strong>殭屍馬</strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需將白兔的名稱改為<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>killer</strong></span>，即可召喚<strong>殺手兔</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:18px\"><strong>你可以改變活體潛影貝的顏色。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只需將潛影貝命名為你想要的顏色即可。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">red</span> | <span style=\"color:#f90\">orange </span>| <span style=\"color:#fc0\">yellow </span>| <span style=\"color:#0f0\">lime</span> | <span style=\"color:#396\">green</span> | <span style=\"color:#00f\">blue</span> | <span style=\"color:#008080\">cyan</span> | <span style=\"color:#0cf\">light_blue</span> | <span style=\"color:#f9c\">pink</span> | <span style=\"color:#f0f\">magenta</span> | <span style=\"color:#800080\">purple </span>| <span style=\"color:#930\">brown</span> | black | <span style=\"color:#808080\">gray</span> | <span style=\"color:#999\">light_gray</span> | <span style=\"color:#999\">white</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong>你可以獲得彩色的史萊姆頭顱。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">只需將史萊姆命名為你想要的顏色即可。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">red</span> | <span style=\"color:#f90\">orange </span>| <span style=\"color:#fc0\">yellow </span>| <span style=\"color:#0f0\">lime</span> | <span style=\"color:#396\">green</span> | <span style=\"color:#00f\">blue</span> | <span style=\"color:#008080\">cyan</span> | <span style=\"color:#0cf\">light_blue</span> | <span style=\"color:#f9c\">pink</span> | <span style=\"color:#f0f\">magenta</span> | <span style=\"color:#800080\">purple </span>| <span style=\"color:#930\">brown</span> | black | <span style=\"color:#808080\">gray</span> | <span style=\"color:#999\">light_gray</span> | <span style=\"color:#999\">white</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#36f\"><strong>你可以在所有生物群系中取得未轉職村民。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">只需將未轉職村民命名為 \"nitwit\" 即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">單一生物可掉落多個頭顱。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><strong>凋靈首領</strong>有 4 種不同的頭顱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#808080\"><strong>惡魂</strong>有 2 種不同的頭顱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#3cc\"><strong>災厄掠奪者（Vex）</strong>有 2 種不同的頭顱。</span></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#800000\"><strong>焰蹄獸</strong>有 2 種不同的頭顱。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">內建進度收集系統。</span></strong></span> <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RQlHG1s.png\" width=\"1008\" height=\"560\"></span></strong></span> &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你對架設包含此數據包的伺服器感興趣，請點擊下方圖片！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[![bh](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fpartners%252fcustom-banners%252f851eaea2-eda5-4cef-87b0-a03c8608ac98.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/851eaea2-eda5-4cef-87b0-a03c8608ac98.png</a>)](<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/MrMLDEG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/MrMLDEG</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用折扣碼&nbsp;**MrMLDEG**&nbsp;作為新客戶租用他們的任何遊戲伺服器，首月可享&nbsp;**25%**&nbsp;折扣。</p>",
